app_authorize.description:
The device has not sent its configuration to Home Assistant yet.

**Client:** {client_name}

**Integrity code:** {integrity_code}

If the indoor station lists a pending app under **System Settings → APP Settings**, approve it there. Keep this client in MyBuildings and the Welcome app. **Submit** sends the pairing request again with the same identity and waits another 90 seconds.{debug_report}

pending_pairing.description:
Home Assistant has a saved app-managed pairing request. Resuming sends the pairing request again with the saved certificate and waits for the device's configuration; it does not create another MyBuildings client.

**Client:** {client_name}

**Integrity code:** {integrity_code}

Choose **Resume saved pairing** unless this client has already been removed from the Welcome client list and MyBuildings.

progress.poll_acl:
Waiting for the gateway to confirm the pairing (check {attempt} of {attempts}).

**Client:** {client_name}

**Integrity code:** {integrity_code}

This can take a few minutes. If it fails, a debug report will be shown that you can copy into an issue.
